	(descr "HRO TYPE-C-31-G-07 USB Type-C plug, 24 contacts in two rows on one face of the board, shell on two legs through slots and two surface pads. Pad and slot positions from the drawing's recommended layout; contact pad width and the solder paste on the legs' lands from JLCPCB's footprint for C530607. The shell overhangs the board edge, which is drawn 0.10 mm back from the shell's rear face, and each slot is 0.20 mm longer than the drawing's at the end nearer that edge.")
